.DS_Store
node_modules/

# Card artwork, for every content source. These are whole card faces lifted from the PDF:
# Prohibited Content under the DPCGL, and a pull request carrying art can't be merged whatever
# else is in it (CONTRIBUTING.md). The renderer falls back to a CSS-only card without them.
#
# Art now lives beside the content it belongs to — data/<source>/card-art/ — so one rule per
# source folder would be a rule to forget the day someone adds their own. `data/*/card-art/`
# covers every folder that exists and every folder that will. The old flat path is kept because
# a checkout from before the move still has one.
data/card-art/
data/*/card-art/

# Your own source list, naming folders nobody else has. data/sources.json is the tracked one.
data/sources.local.json
